  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is haggling at a flea market rude, or is it expected?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.39,
   "block": "shopping.dlg15",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "At most flea markets it's expected, especially on bigger items. Sellers often price things with a bit of room built in.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.51,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "shopping.dlg15"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Can I ask about something else? At the end of interviews they always ask if I have questions, and I never do.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 1.11,
   "block": "job_interview.ctx3",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Let's fix that. Would you rather ask about the team and daily work, or about growth and where the role leads?",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.59,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.ctx3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'd like eighteen seconds of quiet to work it out, then you can ask me again.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.81,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "think_time",
   "wait_sec": 18,
   "phrasing": "think_instruction_v2_13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Okay, I'll hold on.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.2,
   "role": "ack",
   "phrasing": "ack_13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, but then again",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "anchor": {
